.DS_Store
*.log
# ...except raw benchmark evidence. A run's server logs ARE the primary record --
# docs/SLO.md section 9 puts the startup log above every derivation in this repo --
# and `*.log` silently dropped nine of them on 2026-08-26, the day the volume
# holding the only other copy was deleted. Caught by a file count, not by eye.
!docs/benchmarks/raw/**/*.log
__pycache__/
.venv/
bin/
results/
# ...except a harvested run's results, for the same reason as the *.log rule
# above and caught the same way, by a file count: run 3's harness writes one JSON
# per level into results/, and that directory IS the measurement -- 144 files of
# it (docs/benchmarks/raw/l40s-2026-08-30/README.md).
!docs/benchmarks/raw/**/results/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
.terraform/

# pytest's own cache, which today is hidden only by the `*` in the directory it
# writes for itself -- a coincidence, not a rule.
.pytest_cache/
